{
 "template": "cheatsheet",
 "theme": "learn",
 "data": {
  "title": "Claude, *past the basics*",
  "subtitle": "Twenty-six small habits on one page. Start with five.",
  "columns": 2,
  "number_panels": false,
  "panels": [
   {
    "title": "Set it up once",
    "column": 1,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**1** Write your **Instructions** once",
       "**2** Read and fix your **memory**",
       "**3** One-off chat? Memory off first"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Ask so it lands",
    "column": 1,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**4** One full message, not five",
       "**5** Brief it like a new colleague",
       "**6** Say what to do, and why",
       "**7** Show one example of good",
       "**8** Document first, question last",
       "**9** Search for facts, **Research** for reports"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Projects and files",
    "column": 1,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**10** A project for each ongoing job",
       "**11** Short instructions, saved decisions",
       "**12** Charts that matter? Send an image",
       "**13** Ask for the file by name",
       "**14** Repeated brief? Make a **skill**"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Copy this",
    "column": 1,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "prompt",
      "text": "Write a handover note for a fresh chat: the goal, what we've decided, the facts and files that matter, the open questions and the next step."
     }
    ],
    "tone": "dark"
   },
   {
    "title": "Check before you trust",
    "column": 2,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**15** Let it say \"I don't know\"",
       "**16** Trace every claim to a source",
       "**17** Open the **Thinking**",
       "**18** \"Sent\" is a claim: check it"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Make usage last",
    "column": 2,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**19** Effort and model to fit the job",
       "**20** Fresh chat, with a handover note",
       "**21** Connectors off when not needed",
       "**22** Check **Settings → Usage** first"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Hand off to Cowork",
    "column": 2,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**23** One outcome, one folder",
       "**24** Approval mode to fit the risk",
       "**25** Schedule the jobs you repeat",
       "**26** Computer use comes last"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "title": "Start with five",
    "column": 2,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "steps",
      "items": [
